{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/Plot_ENG.jpg?t=1748699876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I'll be waiting for you by the window...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paranormal Torment</strong> is a dark and atmospheric psychological journey in the style of <i>P.T.</i>, where you're trapped in a loop of your own memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you walk through a corridor you can\u2019t escape, you keep hearing knocks on the window\u2026 and seeing the silhouette of a little boy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/2.gif?t=1748699876\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/Gameplay_ENG.jpg?t=1748699876\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Loop-based gameplay:</strong> each cycle reveals new fragments of the tragedy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Constant psychological tension</strong> that keeps you on edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Jumpscares</strong> that will make your heart skip a beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Realistic graphics</strong> for maximum immersion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exceptional sound design</strong> that brings the horror to life</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Classic walking simulator</strong> experience \u2014 just you and your guilt</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Simple yet engaging puzzles</strong> that deepen the story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Average playtime: 30\u201360 minutes</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Will you find a way out \u2014 or become part of this house forever?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/1.gif?t=1748699876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/Attention_ENG.jpg?t=1748699876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note! The game features machine translation into the following languages:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">French</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">German</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Spanish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Portuguese (Brazilian)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chinese (Simplified)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Korean</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Polish</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Japanese</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3512250?t=1748699876","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/06190205b24fdf0a1db09db7e4f5f1f0f4e4db9b/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748699876","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/f34cf2714b0b5bd60b1570d8ecdcf45b6bcb00ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748699876","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/f34cf2714b0b5bd60b1570d8ecdcf45b6bcb00ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748699876","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3512250/extras/Plot_ENG.jpg?t=1748699876\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;I'll be waiting for you by the window...&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Paranormal Torment</strong> is a dark and atmospher